  "headline": "Federal Police Report Clears Justice Mendonça In Banco Master Case",
  "seoTitle": "Federal Police Report Clears Justice Mendonça",
  "metaDescription": "A Federal Police report submitted to the Supreme Court confirms no direct communication between Justice André Mendonça and banker Daniel Vorcaro.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Federal Police reported to the Supreme Court that no direct messages were found between Justice André Mendonça and banker Daniel Vorcaro.",
    "Justice Mendonça was mentioned in 11 separate conversations involving third parties according to the police investigation findings.",
    "Supreme Court Justice Edson Fachin removed the confidentiality of the report following a formal request from Justice Mendonça."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Federal Police (PF) recently submitted a report to the Supreme Court (STF) regarding potential links between various ministers and the ongoing Banco Master case. According to the investigation, while banker Daniel Vorcaro mentioned Justice André Mendonça in 11 different dialogues with other parties, there were no records of direct communication between the two. Justice Mendonça has previously acknowledged meeting the banker in 2025 at an institute where he was a partner in São Paulo. Following the release of the report, Justice Edson Fachin, the rapporteur for the case, lifted the document's confidentiality at Mendonça's request. Justice Gilmar Mendes stated he does not oppose the disclosure of these reports, though he noted that such transparency measures may not address the broader questions surrounding the case. The Prosecutor-General's Office (PGR) is currently evaluating evidence related to several ministers.",
